    "srcXL": "https://photos.smugmug.com/Other/Photo-Shoots/Pennsylvania/Old-Bedford-Historical-Village/OBV-Wild-West-Weekend-2025/i-5HpSkgR/0/NV5hG2zP8SbsSN6V79RKZ5nqm6HmS2N92XFShpNW7/L/_HF23379-819-2-L.jpg",
