    "srcS": "https://photos.smugmug.com/Other/Photo-Shoots/South-Dakota/Artist-Ride-2025/i-wfqSGcV/0/L2nwL9SnLmx2WngswF2rRc6LkrSsjZ7bWvNgmq4ct/S/_HF26225-1143-2-S.jpg",
    "srcOriginal": "",
